@[reboot step]
You should be all done with the installation! Congratulations! Time to reboot
into your installed system! Just type:

  @[reboot]

When you first log in, run @[man smgl-setup]: it walks you through what to do
with your new system (updating grimoires and sorcery, compile options, ...).

We don't (yet) eject CDs during shutdown, and no spell can dispel your USB
stick from its port, so take the CD or stick out while the machine restarts
(or tell the firmware not to boot from it first).
